      {
        "number": 14,
        "internalPageId": 13,
        "title": "B. Listen to two tourist talking about some places they have visited. Which are these places? What are they saying? Tell your teacher.",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "B. Listen to two tourist talking about some places they have visited. Which are these places? What are they saying? Tell your teacher.",
          "C. Read the following paragraph and identify where the comparisons are. After that, Answer the questions next to it. Finally, read it aloud with your teacher.",
          "Brothers Frank is taller than his brother Jake, but Jake is older than Frank. Both are good students, but Jake is a better runner. Frank is more interested in chess and reading; However, Jake is a better fan of sports and technology. Both speak two languages, though Frank has better French than Jake. Both of them love cars, but Jake is more into F1 races than Frank. They both are in the same school.",
